[center][size=6][color=#93c47d][b]CSS v1.0.11[/b][/color][/size][/center]

[list]
[*]Idle animations stay visible after you leave the Profile name box. Vista rest search keeps its own text too.
[*]BH Proxima and Long Hair Proxima materials can use the game's matching shaders when an old outfit turns grey after a game update.
[*]You can turn Outfit materials off before putting on a CSS outfit without crashing.
[*]Body sliders stop at the outfit's limits and keep your outfit on. The extended Profane Proxima sliders, including Belly 5, work with the updated outfit.
[*]Eve's updated outfits carry your saved Calf size over to the new slider.
[*]Shared Assets 1.0.12 can keep animation and expression support for older outfit versions alongside the new ones.
[/list]
